  "text": "Emergency Veterinarian | Avian & Exotics Vet | MedVet Hilliard\nFor Pet Parents\nFor Veterinarians\nWork at MedVet\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nSpecialties\nResources\nAbout\nFind a Clinic\nSpecialties\nVet Resources\nAbout\nMedVet Training Programs\nFind a Clinic\nReferral Partner Login\nRefer a Patient\nLocations\nFind A Doctor\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSocial Work\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSocial Work\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nReferral Partner Resources\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFor Pet Parents\nFind Care\nSpecialties\nResources\nAbout\nFor Veterinarians\nSpecialties\nVet Resources\nAbout\nMedVet Training Programs\nWork at MedVet\nEmergency Care\nRefer a Patient\n24/7 ER / Urgent Care\nSpecialty\nHilliard Emergency Vet & Specialty Care\nHours:\nER Open 24/7\nEmail:\ninfo.hilliard@medvet.com\nPhone:\n614.870.0480\nAddress:\n4050 Britton Pkwy\nHilliard, OH 43026\nFax:\n614.870.0486\nDirections:\nGet Directions\nSet as My Location\nLoading map...\nUnable to load map. Please check your internet connection and try again.\nRetry\nSpecialty Services at MedVet Hilliard\nAvian & Exotics\nEmergency Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nPrevious Slide\nNext Slide\nExpert Emergency and Specialty Care for Dogs, Cats, Birds, and Exotic Pets\nMedVet Hilliard serves as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced emergency and specialty pet care. Whether furry, feathered, or scaley, your pet is a part of your family, and we treat every pet like our own. You can count on our team to provide the most comprehensive and compassionate care.\nOur team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. In addition to caring for cats and dogs, our unique specialty offerings attract avian and exotics patients from across Ohio and beyond. You’ll find caregivers with the expertise and state-of-the-art resources to diagnose your pet and provide the best care.\nIf your dog, cat, bird, or other exotic pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed.\nSave\nMedVet Hilliard Caregivers\nSearch by Name\nFilter by Specialty\nAll Specialties\nAvian & Exotics\nEmergency Medicine\nSurgery\nOur Hospital Leaders\nMikaela Disbennett, DVM\nMedical Director\nAnastacia Landis, RVT\nHospital Director\nOur Doctors\nSebastien J. Banos\n, DVM\nAvian & Exotics\nSarah Bisgard\n, DVM, DACVS (Small Animal)\nSurgery\nBo Bolinger\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMikaela Disbennett\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEmily Fagundo\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nColleen M. Gallagher\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nNoah Goldfarb\n, DVM\nAvian & Exotics\nMercedes Hernandez\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nKathryn M. Hollar\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nEthan Horst\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nNicholas Jew\n, DVM, DABVP\nAvian & Exotics\nMcKenzie Livengood\n, DVM\nAvian & Exotics\nVera Luttmer (Kazaniwskyj)\n, DVM, MPH-VPH, DACVPM\nEmergency Medicine\nSarah Mazur\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nBarbara Oglesbee\n, DVM, DABVP (Avian Practice), DACEPM\nAvian & Exotics\nHannah Primrose\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJared Shields\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nMorgan Van Dyk\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJordan Walters\n, DVM\nEmergency Medicine\nJade Werner\n, DVM, MS\nEmergency Medicine\nShow All Doctors (\n20\n)\nPet Stories\n“\nI couldn’t recommend a better place than MedVet for pet emergencies. Our sweet doodle, Sunny, ingested grapes and was hospitalized for days. The incredibly friendly staff provided quick care, sent updates with pictures, and were clear about treatment. They treated her with love. I’m so grateful for keeping our girl healthy.”\nPrevious Story\nNext Story\nFinancing Options\nWe understand that planning for the cost of care is important. Special financing and payment arrangements are available for qualified pet owners through an independent company, CareCredit.\nLearn More\nFind a location\nEmergency Care\nFind Care\nFind a Location\nFind A Doctor\nResources\nPet Care Resources\nClinical Studies\nAbout\nWe Are MedVet\nMedVet Experience\nOur Leaders\nOur Founders\nNewsroom\nDiversity, Inclusion, & Belonging\nCommunity Support\nFAQs\nContact Us\nFor Veterinarians\nClinical Studies\nContinuing Education\nCareers\nMedVet Open Positions at New Hospitals\nMedVet Training Programs\nSpecialties\nSpecialties Overview\nAnesthesia & Pain Management\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nCritical Care\nDentistry & Oral Surgery\nDermatology\nEmergency Medicine\nIntegrative Medicine\nInternal Medicine\nInterventional Radiology\nMedical Oncology\nNeurology & Neurosurgery\nOphthalmology\nRadiation Oncology\nRadiology\nRehabilitation\nSports Medicine\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nSocial\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nFacebook\nYouTube\nPartners\nVetRad\nVeterinary Eye Institute\nMedVet Suppliers\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nCA Privacy\nYour Privacy Choices\nTerms\nTransparency in Coverage\nTax Information",
