      "address": "4050 Britton Pkwy, Hilliard, OH 43026",
      "description": "Expert Emergency and Specialty Care for Dogs, Cats, Birds, and Exotic Pets   MedVet Hilliard serves as an extension of your family veterinarian by providing advanced emergency and specialty pet care. Whether furry, feathered, or scaley, your pet is a part of your family, and we treat every pet like our own. You can count on our team to provide the most comprehensive and compassionate care.   Our team is a trusted partner in care for family veterinarians and pet lovers. In addition to caring for cats and dogs, our unique specialty offerings attract avian and exotics patients from across Ohio and beyond. You’ll find caregivers with the expertise and state-of-the-art resources to diagnose your pet and provide the best care.    If your dog, cat, bird, or other exotic pet is facing an emergency, you can come directly to our hospital – no appointment is needed.  Save",
